AGPL-licensed images: Corresponding Source
==========================================

Some recipe images include AGPL-3.0 code. Their Corresponding Source is this
repository: each image carries the labels org.opencontainers.image.source (this
repository) and ai.vonkforge.recipes-revision (the commit it was built from),
and the adapter directory at that commit, with the upstream commits pinned in
its vendored-upstream.json, is the complete build source. An image built before
the ai.vonkforge.recipes-revision label existed carries ai.vonkforge.build-key;
any commit whose build plan gives that key holds the same source.
